  "description": "LAION CLAP HTSAT Fused is a contrastive language-audio model for audio-text retrieval and zero-shot audio classification. This Forge wrapper accepts WAV, FLAC, MP3, or OGG audio as a data URI/base64 payload, or a bounded HTTPS audio_url after public-address validation, and returns ranked prompt scores for user-provided candidate labels. The default prompt set covers cough, sneeze, wheeze, breathing, speech, music, silence, and background noise examples. The upstream artifact is public, ungated, disabled=false, Apache-2.0 licensed, and pinned at Hugging Face commit 365dea6ef167def6676140ed93bbc43f84dabb28. This is not a diagnostic, clinical triage, emergency response, or public-health surveillance system.",
